          <div class="ct-row"><span class="ct-game">Physics tick</span><span class="ct-python">Function</span><span class="ct-real">Data processing step</span></div>
          <div class="ct-row"><span class="ct-game">Game loop</span><span class="ct-python">while loop</span><span class="ct-real">Web server request loop</span></div>
